{"availability":"available","full":"devhimanshuu/Agent-Studio","name":"Agent-Studio","description":"Agent Studio — Enterprise-grade AI Agent Platform built with Next.js 15, TypeScript, LangGraph JS & Prisma PostgreSQL. Create, schema-validate, version, and execute dynamic user-defined AI skills safely under strict tool permissions and Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) write approval guardrails.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-02T18:42:10Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:48:00Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agent-studio-v1.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://agent-studio-v1.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:21.865Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:21.865Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:21.865Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:21.865Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Enterprise-grade Visual AI Agent & Multi-Agent Orchestration Platform where users can build complex agent graphs on an interactive node canvas, orchestrate multi-step workflows, convert and import Dify and n8n pipelines, manage schema-validated AI skills with immutable versioning, connect and discover Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools, execute under strict tool permissions and Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) approval guardrails, and stream live execution telemetry via Server-Sent Events (SSE).","Agent Studio is a production-grade Visual AI Agent Platform combining the visual graph architecture of LangGraph Studio, the enterprise control of LangSmith, and the modularity of the Model Context Protocol (MCP) built on Next.js 15 and React Flow.","Users can visually design Multi-Agent Graphs, orchestrate Chained Workflows, import Dify YAML and n8n JSON workflows via AST converters, connect to Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers from a public directory of 500+ servers, configure Reusable Skills, version them like software, chain them into Skill Chains, build Server Compositions, track Live Model Pricing from OpenRouter and Groq, monitor Health Dashboards, and execute on an autonomous Graph Interpreter Runtime (v2) with real-time SSE streaming, permission validation, circuit-breaker LLM routing, and HITL approval gates."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devhimanshuu/Agent-Studio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a9b12acb6dc3aff034112fb77f0a6011ea002f8f1e66fa7c96d2928c8c5ef9d7","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:22.015Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:22.015Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Enterprise-grade Visual AI Agent & Multi-Agent Orchestration Platform where users can build complex agent graphs on an interactive node canvas, orchestrate multi-step workflows, convert and import Dify and n8n pipelines, manage schema-validated AI skills with immutable versioning, connect and discover Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools, execute under strict tool permissions and Human-in-the-Loop (HITL) approval guardrails, and stream live execution telemetry via Server-Sent Events (SSE).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devhimanshuu/Agent-Studio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a9b12acb6dc3aff034112fb77f0a6011ea002f8f1e66fa7c96d2928c8c5ef9d7","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devhimanshuu/Agent-Studio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:22.016Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T05:48:00Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/devhimanshuu/Agent-Studio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:14:22.018Z","hash":"a9b12acb6dc3aff034112fb77f0a6011ea002f8f1e66fa7c96d2928c8c5ef9d7","originalBytes":50452,"storedBytes":50452,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["api","mcp","execution","graph","agent","canvas","sse","node","tool","end","subgraph","live","server","skills","visual","approval","get","post","tools","search","class","color","executions","fill","llm","prisma","state","classdef","cl